# Local deny patterns for scan-public-hygiene.sh (one ripgrep regex per line).
# Copy to ~/.ai-playbook/public-hygiene.patterns and customize from your facts document.
# Do not commit the populated file. Avoid blank lines (rg -f treats them as match-all).
#
# Match employer org as a word (domain OR path segment), not only `org\.`:
#   \byour-org\b
# Ticket prefixes and emails:
#   YOUR_PREFIX-[0-9]
#   @(gmail|your-domain)\.
# your-github-handle
